general_comments.body:
@wraithgar 

> You were right, this should have been a `chore`. The contributing.md file is not part of the published module.

Thanks for confirming! It's a minor point and I don't think that is worth trying to correct for this particular PR / commit. However, it is good to have guidance on the right way to handle commits for the `CONTRIBUTING.md` document in future.

